{"seq":1,"slug":"oil-painting","title":"大学美术学 — 油画","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/arts/fine-arts/painting/oil-painting","wordCount":1789,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"大学美术学-油画\">大学美术学 — 油画</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>油画以干性植物油（亚麻仁油、核桃油、罂粟油）调和矿物与化学颜料为基本媒介，自 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>15</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">15</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15</span></span></span></span></span> 世纪凡·艾克兄弟完善配方以来，逐步取代蛋彩画成为西方绘画的主流技法。油画的核心优势在于：颜料干燥缓慢，允许长时间的色层叠加与修改；色彩饱和度高且持久；透明与不透明画法均可实现，表现力极为丰富。</p>\n<p>对于自学者而言，掌握油画需要同时理解材料科学与视觉表达两个维度：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>材料体系</strong>：底材（亚麻布、棉布、木板）的选择影响画面质感与耐久性；底涂（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>gesso</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{gesso}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">gesso</span></span></span></span></span></span>）的吸油性决定了颜料的附着方式；媒介剂（调色油、松节油、达玛树脂）控制颜料的流动性、透明度与干燥速度</li>\n<li><strong>色彩理论在油画中的实践</strong>：色相环（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>color wheel</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{color wheel}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">color wheel</span></span></span></span></span></span>）、互补色对比、色温控制是调色的基本工具。油画颜料的混合遵循减色法——红 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span></span></span></span></span> 蓝 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span></span></span></span> 紫，但实际操作中不同颜料的化学属性导致混色结果常常偏离理论预期</li>\n<li><strong>技法层次</strong>：从薄涂（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>scumble</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{scumble}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">scumble</span></span></span></span></span></span>）到厚涂（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>impasto</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{impasto}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8623em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">impasto</span></span></span></span></span></span>），从透明罩染（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>glazing</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{glazing}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">glazing</span></span></span></span></span></span>）到直接画法（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>alla prima</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{alla prima}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">alla prima</span></span></span></span></span></span>），每种技法对应不同的视觉效果与创作节奏</li>\n<li><strong>观察方法</strong>：整体观察优先于局部刻画，&quot;眯眼看&quot;是建立大关系（明暗、色调）的核心习惯</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"油画材料与工具\">油画材料与工具</h3><p>一套基本的油画材料包含以下组件：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>材料类别</th>\n<th>核心选项</th>\n<th>自学建议</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>画布</td>\n<td>亚麻布（弹性好、耐久）、棉布（经济）</td>\n<td>初学可用预制画框棉布，进阶转亚麻布</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>颜料</td>\n<td>艺术家级（高色素浓度）、学生级</td>\n<td>起步用学生级，白色和常用色选艺术家级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>画笔</td>\n<td>猪鬃（硬毛，适合厚涂）、貂毛/尼龙（软毛，适合细节）</td>\n<td>准备 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span>—<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span></span></span></span></span> 支不同尺寸的扁头笔和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 支圆头笔</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>调色板</td>\n<td>木质/玻璃/纸质</td>\n<td>玻璃调色板易清洗，推荐中灰色底</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>媒介剂</td>\n<td>松节油（稀释清洗）、调色油（增加流动性）、达玛光油</td>\n<td>&quot;肥盖瘦&quot;原则：底层少油，表层逐渐加油</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>&quot;肥盖瘦&quot;原则</strong>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>fat over lean</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{fat over lean}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">fat over lean</span></span></span></span></span></span>）是油画分层的核心法则：下层使用更多稀释剂（&quot;瘦&quot;），上层逐渐增加油脂含量（&quot;肥&quot;）。违反这一原则会导致上层先干燥收缩而下层尚湿，造成龟裂。</p>\n<h3 id=\"色彩与调色\">色彩与调色</h3><p>油画调色是从理论到直觉的修炼过程。基本色彩体系可以从限制调色板开始：</p>\n<p><strong>齐翁色盘</strong>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Zorn palette</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Zorn palette}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Zorn palette</span></span></span></span></span></span>）仅用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span> 种颜料——钛白、象牙黑、镉黄、朱红（或镉红），即可混出令人惊讶的丰富色域。这种限制训练迫使学习者深入理解色温关系：象牙黑偏冷蓝，与镉黄混合产生橄榄绿色调。</p>\n<p>色彩混合的实用规则：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>每次混色不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 种颜料，避免灰浊</li>\n<li>先在调色板上充分混合，再上画布</li>\n<li>观察并记录&quot;色串&quot;——一个色彩从亮到暗的完整变化序列</li>\n<li>暖光照射下，受光面偏暖、阴影偏冷；冷光反之</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"传统画法-间接画法\">传统画法：间接画法</h3><p>古典油画大师（提香、伦勃朗、维米尔）多采用间接画法，即分层推进：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>素描底稿</strong>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>drawing</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{drawing}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">drawing</span></span></span></span></span></span>）：用铅笔或稀薄颜料在画布上确定构图</li>\n<li><strong>单色底画</strong>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>underpainting/grisaille</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{underpainting/grisaille}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">underpainting/grisaille</span></span></span></span></span></span>）：用灰褐色系建立完整的明暗关系</li>\n<li><strong>死色层</strong>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>dead coloring</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{dead coloring}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">dead coloring</span></span></span></span></span></span>）：以不透明颜料铺设基本色调</li>\n<li><strong>罩染</strong>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>glazing</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{glazing}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">glazing</span></span></span></span></span></span>）：用透明色层叠加，创造深邃的色彩空间和光泽感</li>\n<li><strong>提亮与细节</strong>：最终以不透明厚涂强调高光与关键细节</li>\n</ol>\n<p>维米尔《戴珍珠耳环的少女》中耳环的璀璨光泽，正是通过深色底层上的多层透明罩染再加上精准的高光厚涂点实现的——底层的暗色透过上层的透明色，产生了颜料表面无法直接混合的光学深度。</p>\n<h3 id=\"直接画法与现代表达\">直接画法与现代表达</h3><p>印象派以后，直接画法（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>alla prima</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{alla prima}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">alla prima</span></span></span></span></span></span>）成为主流——在一次作画过程中完成画面，颜料层间不等待干燥。这种方法强调：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>准确的第一笔——每一笔同时解决形状、色彩和明暗</li>\n<li>保留笔触的生动性，不做过度修饰</li>\n<li>对画面整体色调关系的即时把控能力</li>\n</ul>\n<p>弗洛伊德（卢西安·弗洛伊德）的人体油画代表了直接画法的当代高峰：厚重的颜料堆积呈现出皮肤的物质感，每一笔都带有画家的身体力度和观察节奏。</p>\n<h3 id=\"自学练习路径\">自学练习路径</h3><p>建议按以下顺序循序渐进：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[色块练习&lt;br&gt;混色与铺色] --&gt; B[静物写生&lt;br&gt;单色到全色]&#10;    B --&gt; C[石膏像/肖像&lt;br&gt;人物造型]&#10;    C --&gt; D[风景写生&lt;br&gt;光色变化]&#10;    D --&gt; E[主题创作&lt;br&gt;个人表达]\">graph LR\n    A[色块练习&lt;br&gt;混色与铺色] --&gt; B[静物写生&lt;br&gt;单色到全色]\n    B --&gt; C[石膏像/肖像&lt;br&gt;人物造型]\n    C --&gt; D[风景写生&lt;br&gt;光色变化]\n    D --&gt; E[主题创作&lt;br&gt;个人表达]</pre><p>每个阶段都应交替进行临摹名作与写生训练。临摹帮助理解前人的技法逻辑，写生培养对真实视觉信息的转化能力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>使用齐翁色盘（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span> 色限制）完成一幅 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>30</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>40</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">30\\times40</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">40</span></span></span></span></span> cm 的自画像练习，体会从有限色彩中获取丰富表现力的过程。</li>\n<li>选择同一个简单静物（如一个苹果），分别用间接画法（单色底画 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span></span></span></span></span> 罩染）和直接画法（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>alla prima</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{alla prima}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">alla prima</span></span></span></span></span></span>）各画一遍，比较两种方法在色彩深度、表面质感和用时上的差异。</li>\n<li>在美术馆中近距离观察一幅古典油画和一幅印象派油画的表面肌理——笔触的方向、颜料的厚薄、画布纹理的可见度。用手机拍摄局部放大图并做笔记。</li>\n<li>&quot;肥盖瘦&quot;原则的物理依据是什么？如果违反会产生什么后果？尝试用材料科学的角度解释。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>拉尔夫·迈耶《艺术家手册》——油画材料与技法的百科全书，专业工作室必备</li>\n<li>理查德·施密德《Alla Prima: Everything I Know About Painting》——直接画法的当代经典</li>\n<li>詹姆斯·格尔尼《色与光：写实画家指南》——用科学方法理解视觉色彩现象</li>\n<li>各大油画教学 YouTube 频道（Andrew Tischler、Florent Farges）提供了大量免费的步骤演示</li>\n<li>定期访问本地美术馆或画廊，养成&quot;看原作&quot;的习惯——屏幕无法替代对笔触与材质的真实感知</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>油画学习的核心路径是&quot;材料理解→色彩控制→技法积累→个人表达&quot;。掌握&quot;肥盖瘦&quot;等材料法则避免物理层面的失败，通过限制调色板训练色彩感知力，在间接画法与直接画法的交替实践中找到属于自己的创作节奏。油画是一门需要大量实践时间积累的技艺——每一幅习作都是在用画笔思考，理论知识最终要在画布上被身体记住。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"大学美术学 — 油画","id":"大学美术学-油画"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"油画材料与工具","id":"油画材料与工具"},{"level":3,"text":"色彩与调色","id":"色彩与调色"},{"level":3,"text":"传统画法：间接画法","id":"传统画法-间接画法"},{"level":3,"text":"直接画法与现代表达","id":"直接画法与现代表达"},{"level":3,"text":"自学练习路径","id":"自学练习路径"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"大学美术学 — 现当代艺术","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/arts/fine-arts/art-history/modern-contemporary"},"next":{"title":"大学美术学 — 中国画","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/arts/fine-arts/painting/chinese-painting"}}